 good old-fashioned values

00:00:11.550 --> 00:00:14.380
On which we used to rely?

00:00:14.460 --> 00:00:18.130
Lucky there's a family guy

00:00:18.210 --> 00:00:21.630
Lucky there's a man who
 positively can do

00:00:21.710 --> 00:00:23.210
All the things that make us

00:00:23.210 --> 00:00:24.390
Laugh and cry

00:00:24.470 --> 00:00:29.570
He's... a...
Fam... ily... Guy!

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:40.650
Wow, someone seems happy today.

00:00:40.730 --> 00:00:43.000
Damn right.
Today's the big day.

00:00:43.080 --> 00:00:44.490
You're getting off parole?

00:00:44.570 --> 00:00:47.660
Does this mean I can finally
stop giving you my pee?

00:00:47.857 --> 00:00:50.837
Not yet, so stay off drugs
and keep that hose flowing.

00:00:52.050 --> 00:00:54.470
Tonight is girls' night.

00:00:54.550 --> 00:00:56.630
